_category_count":1},{"business_id":"_Bi9kN_eR75G1eqIl7S3pA","name":"The Bulldog","shared_categories":"Food","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"AU-B663F3MPO7W-goWwwXA","name":"B Mac's","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"TMBbCDQG6bENJoQSST0XiA","name":"Brigtsen's Restaurant","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"_C7QiQQc47AOEv4PE3Kong","name":"Commander's Palace","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"mhrW9O0O5hXGXGnEYBVoag","name":"Jacques-Imo's Cafe","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"8KnMSrMuTI2AtHZ2LOI8OQ","name":"Maurepas Foods","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"Zi-F-YvyVOK0k5QD7lrLOg","name":"Muriel's Jackson Square","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"JhpRI9m71ybWHkAqRdL0Tg","name":"The Avenue Pub","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0}],"text":[{"business_id":"olUu3rOO7IjL0ai9uaZUWw","review_id":"JE11-GcxvbspWf4-czfFpg","date":"2016-09-03T05:47:30","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.8930217027664185,"text_excerpt":"Brothers has a sketchy reputation but they definitely exceeded expectations on this visit. I stopped by for a meat pie and apple juice. When I entered the store, there was a line of 8 people but they quickly assisted everyone and I was in line less than a minute. The food was fresh, my drink was cold, and I left a happy customer."},{"business_id":"olUu3rOO7IjL0ai9uaZUWw","review_id":"X4GeS60XZU4IUjmbPvKjfw","date":"2012-12-10T15:37:26","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.8784147500991821,"text_excerpt":"This is the cheapest gas (name brand) that I've found in Algiers. It's my go to spot when I need to gas up for the week (it's cheaper than Uptown). However, I have found cheaper name brand gas in Gretna and Harvey but that's out of my way! It's well lit, even at night. It can be crowded but I've never had to wait long (usually I'm there Sunday afternoon/evening). Plus there is a Brother's chicken that smells so darned good that it makes me want to get some (can we say meat pies chicken). It's right off General DeGaulle which is convenient. There is also a laundrymat and a beauty store in this strip mall which makes parking pretty tight."},{"business_id":"olUu3rOO7IjL0ai9uaZUWw","review_id":"kXn6lvJ0N3YZu9Bca7UycA","date":"2012-12-31T22:39:15","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.8448472023010254,"text_excerpt":"Love this place! Methinks i shall try on something in a green apple four loco this evening, my good man. meet me and pablo by the tree if you're in the area and looking for some action, IT'S GOING DOWN!"}],"visual":[]},"notebook_case":null}
